Third-party material
--------------------

Part of the French vocabulary in this dictionary was gathered from the
French quest text in the MultiLanguage addon by Ruben Zantingh
(https://github.com/rubenzantingh/MultiLanguage), used with his permission
given on 2 September 2026.

Blizzard's Game Data API publishes a quest's title and description and nothing
else. It does not publish the objective line, the text an NPC speaks while a
quest is in progress, or the text spoken when it is handed in, and those three
are a large part of what a player actually reads.

Modifications made by Ironship, 2 September 2026:

  * That text was read for the words it contains: 13,590 objective lines, 5,922 progress lines and 11,331 hand-in lines,
    covering 4,627 quests the API does not return at all.
  * What this addon ships is not that text. Quest text stays in Data/cache,
    which is outside the repository and is never packaged. What ships is a list
    of single words, each with an English translation and an explanatory note
    written for this project. No quest sentence is reproduced.
  * Where Blizzard's API had already supplied a field, its wording was kept.

The import is performed by Tools/import_multilanguage.py, which is part of the
corresponding source of this work.

